# MCP (dev tooling)

Full setup: **`docs/ops/mcp-dev.md`** — bootstrap with `make setup-cursor`.

Config: [`.cursor/mcp.json`](../mcp.json) (from [`.cursor/mcp.json.example`](../mcp.json.example)). Credentials only in `.env` / `.env.staging` (`envFile`); never commit passwords.

Session hook: [`.cursor/hooks.json`](../hooks.json) injects `autonomous-dev-workflow.mdc` reminder on `sessionStart`.

## Servers (use proactively)

| MCP server | Stack | When |
|------------|-------|------|
| **remnawave-postgres** | Production | Live schema, balances, subscriptions — read-only |
| **remnawave-redis** | Production | Prod cart/cache/TTL |
| **remnawave-staging-postgres** | Staging | After `make staging-rebuild` — debug staging smoke data |
| **remnawave-staging-redis** | Staging | Staging carts/cache |
| **context7** (plugin) | — | React/Vite/cabinet library docs |

**Rule:** Prefer MCP over guessing DB/Redis state. For i18n/UX iteration debugging, prefer **staging** MCP servers — not production.

## Do not use

| Plugin | Why |
|--------|-----|
| **neon-postgres** | Neon cloud — not Docker Postgres on this host |
| **paradedb** | Docs search only |

## Safety

- Postgres MCP: **read-only** (`restricted`); no DDL/DML.
- Do not paste secrets in chat or commits.
- MCP ≠ substitute for `make smoke`, staging deploy, or user `تایید` before ship/prod.

## If MCP is unavailable

```bash
make setup-cursor          # copy mcp.json, pull images, check networks
docker compose up -d postgres redis
make staging-rebuild       # staging MCP needs staging stack
```

Reload Cursor after editing `mcp.json`.
